{{PCExclusive}}
'''Neko-Musume Cat''' is an [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that is exclusive to the GeGeGe no Kitarou Collaboration Event, only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]]. Its debut date is unknown. Currently, not much is known about this unit.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 913
|rarity = EX
|version = PC
|name1 = Neko-Musume Cat
|name2 = Neko-Musume Cat CC
|image1 = 10913 1.png
|image2 = 10913 2.png
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Neko-Musume Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit shares similar stats with [[Rei Cat (Rare Cat)|Rei Cat]], however, it is much more useful due to its traits appearing more often. It doesn't have much use against Floating enemies, since it will heavily struggle to reach them with its slow speed and poor range. However, the story is much different against Zombies. Its Resistance and Massive damage give it even better stats against them than [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]], on top of its' higher range. Depending on how many Anti-Zombie [[Fruit Treasures]] you have, even one of these could output anywhere from 4,050 to 5,400 DPS at level 30.

{{Job|Classification = Melee & Nuker}}

